@startuml
title SC-ORD-003 — Stock not available: no payment is ever requested
actor Customer as C
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Notification" as N

C -> O : PlaceOrder
O --> C : accepted, order PENDING
O ->> I : ReserveStock
note over I : one line cannot be reserved:\nnothing is reserved at all
I ->> O : StockReservationRejected
note over O #FFCDD2 : COMPENSATED\norder REJECTED, OUT_OF_STOCK
note over P : never called
O ->> N : OrderRejected
N ->> C : rejection e-mail
@enduml
